$DIR/test.p:7:32: invalid operation: shifted operand c (variable of enum type Color) is an enum value (convert it to an integer first)
    Enum values can be compared, but not added, multiplied, shifted or combined
    with bitwise operators, since the result would usually not be a member.
    Convert to an integer to do arithmetic.
    Convert to an integer first:
        next := int(c) + 1
    (see "Enums" in the Plutonium spec, section 7.12)
    (run "pluto explain E2316" for a longer explanation)
